{"id":"n68391-1-11","stage":3,"title":"오락실 · 娱乐室","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n68391-1-11-1","ko":"엄마, 오락실에서 조금만 놀다 오면 안 돼요?","zh":"妈妈，我可以在游戏厅玩一会儿再回来吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}},{"text":"오락실에서","meaning":"娱乐室，游戏室，游戏厅","explanation":"오락실：娱乐室，游戏室，游戏厅；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"오락실","audio":"/audio/55e3be0e892d350eef3c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68391","senseId":"1","lemma":"오락실","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오락실에서","audio":"/audio/00a61f241b78edbb0bc1.mp3"}},{"text":"조금만","meaning":"片刻，一会儿","explanation":"조금：片刻，一会儿；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61176","senseId":"2","lemma":"조금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"조금만","audio":"/audio/61e4375f0847dd284eb0.mp3"}},{"text":"놀다","meaning":"玩儿","explanation":"놀다：玩儿；다：连接途中转换或接续的动作，具体要结合前后文。","readings":[{"term":"놀다","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88353","senseId":"18","lemma":"놀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놀다","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3"}},{"text":"오면","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오면","audio":"/audio/db4c994ab297c56bbe00.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不（안 되다：不可以）","explanation":"안：不（안 되다：不可以）","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"돼요?","meaning":"可以、行","explanation":"되다：可以、行；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돼요","audio":"/audio/9f1cdf460348e44aca12.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"55e3be0e892d350e","term":"오락실","zh":"娱乐室，游戏室，游戏厅","audio":"/audio/55e3be0e892d350eef3c.mp3","entryId":"68391","definition":"设有游戏等娱乐所需要的设施的房间；或指进行娱乐的房间。","pronunciation":["오ː락씰"]},{"id":"b4049b7414b62d9b","term":"조금","zh":"片刻，一会儿","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3","entryId":"61176","definition":"短暂时间。","pronunciation":["조금"]},{"id":"8fc8305f6371680e","term":"놀다","zh":"玩儿","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3","entryId":"88353","definition":"玩游戏。","pronunciation":["놀ː다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了某个目的或事情而从别的地方移动到这里。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不（안 되다：不可以）","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"不（안 되다：不可以）","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"可以、行","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"可以、行","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/486c8104f8e617ecd347.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n68391-1-11-2","ko":"안 돼. 숙제 다 하고 검사받고 가.","zh":"不行。必须先把作业做完，再做完检查才能去。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"안","meaning":"不（안 되다：不可以）","explanation":"안：不（안 되다：不可以）","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Kore